  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Optifine_But_Faster/BH_OBF_Title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1133\" height=\"312\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Optifine_But_Faster/BH_OBF_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1133\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這個模組包在技術上擁有 OF 的所有功能，並且速度更快，但部分功能仍處於實驗階段。完整列表請見下方：</p>\n<p>- 光影（Iris）</p>\n<p>- 帶有光影的 CTM（連續紋理材質）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您正在尋找更多功能，請查看我的其他模組包 FPSPlus，它擁有更多功能&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fpsplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>，或者純粹追求速度的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/bare-bones-speed\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Optifine_But_Faster/BH_OBF_Setup.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1133\" height=\"116\"></p>\n<p>如需安裝協助，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252flimeshulkerbox.com%252fmodpack-setup\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡。</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:limeshulkerbox@gmail.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Sodium/BH_LIME_EMAILCONTACT.png\" width=\"612\" height=\"151\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Lime/bh_op.png\" width=\"1133\" height=\"183\"></a></p>",
